{
  "movie_id": 503800501,
  "subtitles": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "start_time": 0.8,
      "end_time": 2.6,
      "text": "Ohohohoh!"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 2.8,
      "end_time": 4.5,
      "text": "Allow me to present to you all"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 4.7,
      "end_time": 7.2,
      "text": "the Mercurius Foundation's technological prowess!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 13.0,
      "end_time": 15.8,
      "text": "Huh...? I didn't press the go switch yet..."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 16.0,
      "end_time": 17.2,
      "text": "Behold and be awed!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 17.6,
      "end_time": 20.8,
      "text": "This is the culmination of the business ideas"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 21.0,
      "end_time": 23.5,
      "text": "presented to us by the Friendship Club!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 23.7,
      "end_time": 26.2,
      "text": "I call it: Friendbot X!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 26.5,
      "end_time": 29.2,
      "text": "CHE... RUUUUUN!"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 29.6,
      "end_time": 30.8,
      "text": "Huh? Uh, the heck is that?"
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "start_time": 31.2,
      "end_time": 33.8,
      "text": "I mean, how does it look like any of our ideas."
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "start_time": 34.5,
      "end_time": 36.5,
      "text": "This is a total abuse of IP."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "start_time": 37.1,
      "end_time": 40.1,
      "text": "Ahhh! A mysterious mechanism! How thrilling!"
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "start_time": 40.3,
      "end_time": 42.4,
      "text": "It piques my intellectual curiosity!"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "start_time": 42.8,
      "end_time": 46.0,
      "text": "Yep, yep! That activation noise did sound intellectual!"
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "start_time": 46.2,
      "end_time": 50.3,
      "text": "Whaaa...? Why the sudden rave reviews? I don't know you guys..."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "start_time": 50.5,
      "end_time": 53.4,
      "text": "Now, Friendbot X! Greet our friends!"
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "start_time": 55.8,
      "end_time": 58.5,
      "text": "Is Friendbot X malfunctioning somehow?"
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "start_time": 58.8,
      "end_time": 62.0,
      "text": "I... I knyow I built it just like the blueprints said!"
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "start_time": 62.1,
      "end_time": 64.8,
      "text": "Myove it! Myove already, Friendbot X!"
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "start_time": 65.0,
      "end_time": 68.9,
      "text": "First, the name. Is that really the best you could come up with."
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "start_time": 69.0,
      "end_time": 72.4,
      "text": "Huh~? Sounds like a pretty chellerific name to me! Friendbot X!"
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "start_time": 72.6,
      "end_time": 74.3,
      "text": "Hrm... But if the original concept"
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "start_time": 74.4,
      "end_time": 76.7,
      "text": "is derived from the proposals that we provided,"
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "start_time": 76.9,
      "end_time": 79.8,
      "text": "surely the naming rights for this contraption should lie with us."
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "start_time": 80.0,
      "end_time": 82.4,
      "text": "Yes... I dub thee Super Yuni-ette the Great!"
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "start_time": 82.6,
      "end_time": 83.6,
      "text": "Oh no you don't."
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "start_time": 103.8,
      "end_time": 105.3,
      "text": "WHAAAAAAAT?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "start_time": 108.5,
      "end_time": 112.0,
      "text": "It transformed explosively from a sphere into a humanoid?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "start_time": 112.2,
      "end_time": 115.2,
      "text": "So this is Friendbot X's true form..."
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "start_time": 115.6,
      "end_time": 117.2,
      "text": "S... so cool..."
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "start_time": 117.4,
      "end_time": 120.0,
      "text": "...is what this vibe's almost driving me to think, but..."
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "start_time": 121.0,
      "end_time": 123.4,
      "text": "On closer inspection, it just looks dumb."
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "start_time": 127.0,
      "end_time": 130.4,
      "text": "Oh...? Did we install a feature like this?"
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "start_time": 133.0,
      "end_time": 136.0,
      "text": "Akino! I can't control Friendbot X at all!"
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "start_time": 137.0,
      "end_time": 138.6,
      "text": "CHELLOPAPPER CHELLER-LELLERELLO!"
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "start_time": 153.3,
      "end_time": 156.3,
      "text": "HUUUUHHHH?!"
    }
  ],
